@style(../styles/IDocDemo.style)
@title(Charts: Tufte)

Sparklines, slopegraphs, dot-dash plots, small multiples and bullet charts. Each chart is followed by the source that drew it, and every example carries its own data.

@table(widths=equal)
@row
@cell
@b{Sparkline}

A series at word scale — no axes, no frame. Marks the min, the max and where it ended.

@graph(type=sparkline)
@data
v
