@b{Slopegraph}

Many items, two moments, one line each — who rose, who fell, who crossed.

@graph(type=slopegraph, title="Life expectancy")
@data
country,2000,2020
Norway,79,83
Brazil,70,76
India,63,70
Japan,81,85
@end

