@b{Dot-dash plot}

A scatter whose axes ARE the marginal distributions — one tick per observation.

@graph(type=dotdash, x=height, y=weight)
@data
height,weight
158,52
163,55
167,61
171,64
175,70
178,72
182,79
186,84
@end

