@cell
@b{Small multiples}

The same chart once per series, on ONE shared scale — the only honest way to compare many.

@graph(type=smallmultiples, title="Same scale throughout")
@data
month,north,south,east,west
1,5,2,9,4
2,7,3,8,6
3,6,5,7,7
4,9,4,6,5
5,8,6,5,8
@end

@code(idoc)
@graph(type=smallmultiples, title="Same scale throughout")
@data
month,north,south,east,west
1,5,2,9,4
2,7,3,8,6
3,6,5,7,7
4,9,4,6,5
5,8,6,5,8
@end
@end
@endcell
@endtable

@table(widths=equal)
@row
@cell
@b{Bullet chart}

A gauge's information in a fifth of the ink — measure, bands, target. Fits in a table cell.

@graph(type=bullet)
@data
metric,value,target
Revenue,270,300
Profit,180,150
Satisfaction,42,50
@end

@code(idoc)
